  "reasoning": "The defendants forcibly seized the victim, detained him in a temple, beat him causing light injuries, and used violence and threats to obtain money, a gun, a vest and a necklace. This constitutes illegal detention (非法拘禁), robbery (抢劫) because property was taken by force, and intentional injury (故意伤害) due to the inflicted light injuries.",
